OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over cryptocurrency
OL,4,Adrug dealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who used cryptocurrency to
OL,7,Fconceal his drug dealing has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FBenjamin Dack, from the Scarborough
OL,11,Farea, was arrested on numerous
OL,12,Foccasions, after an investigation into
OL,13,Fsuspected dealing started in 2023.
OL,15,FThe 28-year-old, of no fixed abode,
OL,16,Fcontinued to sell cannabis despite his
OL,17,Finitial arrest and a search of his
OL,18,Fphone found he had been using
OL,19,Fcryptocurrency to buy and sell drugs.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
